                <code class="cu-code">data-cu-transfer-check</code> on item checkboxes,
                and <code class="cu-code">data-cu-transfer-to-right</code> /
                <code class="cu-code">data-cu-transfer-to-left</code> on the action buttons.
                The <code class="cu-code">&lt;script&gt;</code> handles checking, moving, and count updates.
